# Deny by default. Add exact files to source-manifest.json and this allowlist.
# Private/agent state (.codex, .agents, .claude, AGENTS.md), .env files, keys,
# profiles, databases, logs, captures, caches, environments and builds stay out.
# These rules do not scrub already-tracked files or historical Git objects.
*

